{"id": "t039-057", "text": "spoke to rin on the phone, her grandad had a stroke last wk and is in st james. they don't know yet if he'll get his speech back. she's going up every evening after work and her mum's basically living at the hospital. rin's also got exams 2-6 dec and doesnt know how she'll revise. should text her sun and maybe offer to bring dinner round one night", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stroke", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last wk", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in st james", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exams", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2-6 dec", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sun", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to bring dinner round", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "one night", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t039-058", "text": "kwame said his wife Zeynep had the baby!! little girl, born 17 oct, 7lb 2. both doing well. they're calling her Ama. need to get a card and something for the baby", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "little girl", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 oct", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "7lb 2", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ama", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card and something for the baby", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
